From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yggdrasil UPC Overlay <yggdrasil@unheaded.dev>
Date: Sun, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] add Unheaded UPC apt source

Yggdrasil ships UPC tooling. The apt source for upc-* binaries is added
to sources.list.d so that `apt update` and `apt install upc-bootctl`
work out of the box. The repo signing key is preinstalled to
/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/unheaded-upc.gpg by the Debian hardening
pipeline (task #65) before this patch applies.

Task #71 — UPC accessible & present on Yggdrasil.

---
 etc/apt/sources.list.d/unheaded-upc.list | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 etc/apt/sources.list.d/unheaded-upc.list

diff --git a/etc/apt/sources.list.d/unheaded-upc.list b/etc/apt/sources.list.d/unheaded-upc.list
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1111111
--- /dev/null
+++ b/etc/apt/sources.list.d/unheaded-upc.list
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# Yggdrasil — Unheaded Protocol Computer apt source
+# Repo built by task #65 (Debian hardening pipeline).
+# Free to use. Free to share.
+deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/unheaded-upc.gpg] https://apt.unheaded.dev/yggdrasil bookworm main
--
2.43.0
